Hello,

When we created the function, we decided to make the titles and axes automatically generated from the metadata associated with the ScoresList object and the ordering data. This is because binPlots can make three types of plots, and the axes have different meanings for different plot types. There are no parameters for modifying the settings you were trying to use. I recommend using a graphics editing program to edit the text.

